@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://confOf#Author> owl:equivalentClass <http://iasted#Author> .

<http://confOf#City> owl:equivalentClass <http://iasted#City> .

<http://confOf#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://iasted#Conference_days> .

<http://confOf#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://iasted#Person> .

<http://confOf#Submission_event> owl:equivalentClass <http://iasted#Submission> .

<http://confOf#Trip> owl:equivalentClass <http://iasted#Trip_day> .

<http://confOf#Tutorial> owl:equivalentClass <http://iasted#Tutorial> .

<http://confOf#earlyRegistration> owl:equivalentProperty <http://iasted#Registration> .

<http://confOf#writes> rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://iasted#write> .

